flowchart TD
  DETECT[Alert or report] --> TRIAGE[Validate and assess impact]
  TRIAGE --> LEAD[Assign incident roles]
  LEAD --> MITIGATE[Safe reversible mitigation]
  MITIGATE --> VERIFY[Verify user-facing recovery]
  VERIFY --> REVIEW[Blameless review]
  REVIEW --> ACTIONS[Track corrective actions]
